{"Title":"RESOLUTIONS DESIGNATING AUGUST 10TH AND 11TH, 2024 AS THE SALES TAX HOLIDAY","BillNumber":"S2825","DocketNumber":"SD3291","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"SLM0","Name":"Susan L. Moran","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/SLM0","ResponseDate":"2024-06-13T09:27:55.767"},"Cosponsors":[],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S2825/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Resolution","Pinslip":"Senate, June 13, 2024 -- Resolutions (filed by Senator Moran) designating August 10th and 11th as the sales tax holiday","DocumentText":"\tWHEREAS, THE GENERAL COURT IS CHARGED WITH ANNUALLY DESIGNATING A SALES TAX HOLIDAY WEEKEND IN THE MONTH OF AUGUST; THEREFORE BE IT\r\n\tRESOLVED, THAT THE DAYS OF AUGUST 10 AND 11 SHALL BE THE SALES TAX HOLIDAY FOR THE YEAR 2024 PURSUANT TO CHAPTER 64H SECTION 6A OF THE GENERAL LAWS.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[],"Amendments":[]}